---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<div class="dc-space">
  <div class="dc-starfield" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="dc-star" style="left:9%;top:12%;width:28px;height:36px;opacity:.9;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 13px rgba(207,230,255,.6))"></span>
    <span class="dc-star" style="left:73%;top:8%;width:20px;height:25px;background:#ffe3b8;opacity:.7;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 9px rgba(207,230,255,.45))"></span>
    <span class="dc-star" style="left:90%;top:62%;width:24px;height:30px;background:#cfe6ff;opacity:.65;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(207,230,255,.45))"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="dc-split">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px">
      <span class="dc-kicker">First time here?</span>
      <h1>There is no agenda yet. That's the point.</h1>
      <p style="margin:0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;max-width:52ch">No keynotes, no slides, no one selling you anything. Twenty conversations, chosen by the people in the room on the morning — including you.</p>
    </div>
    <img class="dc-spin-rocket" src="/assets/images/brand/rocket.png" alt="The DeliverCon rocket, doing a little spin">
  </div>
</div>

<div class="dc-section">
  <div class="dc-section__inner">
    <div class="dc-grid dc-grid--2">
      <div class="dc-tile">
        <span class="dc-tile__icon" aria-hidden="true">🤫</span>
        <h3>You don't have to speak at the front</h3>
        <p>You write your idea on a card. Cards get scored by everyone, so good ideas don't depend on confidence.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-tile">
        <span class="dc-tile__icon" aria-hidden="true">🚪</span>
        <h3>Move rooms whenever you like</h3>
        <p>If a session isn't for you, leave and find one that is. Nobody will be offended — it's the format working.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-tile">
        <span class="dc-tile__icon" aria-hidden="true">⚡️</span>
        <h3>Lightning talks over lunch</h3>
        <p>Five minutes each, any level of experience. Sign up on the day if the mood takes you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dc-tile">
        <span class="dc-tile__icon" aria-hidden="true">🚀</span>
        <h3>Suppliers are welcome</h3>
        <p>Anyone in or around public sector delivery. Come as a peer, not a pitch.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a href="/" class="dc-btn dc-btn--primary" style="margin-top:18px">Back to the event page</a>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="dc-section">
  <div class="dc-section__inner dc-prose" style="max-width:820px">
    <h2>The longer version</h2>
    {{ content | safe }}
  </div>
</div>
